{"seq":1,"slug":"advanced-mathematics-grad","title":"高等数学进阶","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"高等数学进阶-简介\">高等数学进阶 简介</h1><p>高等数学进阶面向数学及相关学科的研究生，系统介绍现代数学的四个核心分支。这些内容构成了数学研究的基本语言和工具，也是理论物理、工程科学和计算机科学等领域深入研究的数学基础。</p>\n<p>本课程设置四个章节，从分析到代数再到几何，构建完整的现代数学知识框架。第一章<strong>实分析</strong>从测度论出发，经由 Lebesgue 积分到泛函分析导引，以严格的公理化方法重建微积分的理论基础，为概率论、偏微分方程等后续学科提供分析工具。第二章<strong>抽象代数</strong>系统讲解群论、环与域理论以及 Galois 理论，揭示代数结构的深层统一性，培养抽象思维和结构化推理的能力。第三章<strong>拓扑学基础</strong>从点集拓扑的基本概念开始，推进到代数拓扑的核心思想和流形理论的入门知识，建立对连续性、连通性和空间结构的直觉理解。第四章<strong>应用数学方法</strong>聚焦偏微分方程方法、数值分析进阶和最优化方法，展示纯数学工具在实际问题求解中的应用路径。</p>\n<p>建议学习者在每个章节中投入充足时间完成证明练习，数学的掌握离不开动手推演。同时注意各章节之间的横向联系，例如拓扑方法在分析中的应用、代数结构在拓扑中的角色。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"real-analysis","title":"实分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/real-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"measure-theory","title":"研究生 高等数学进阶 — 测度论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/real-analysis/measure-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lebesgue-integration","title":"研究生 高等数学进阶 — Lebesgue 积分","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/real-analysis/lebesgue-integration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"functional-analysis-intro","title":"研究生 高等数学进阶 — 泛函分析导引","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/real-analysis/functional-analysis-intro"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"abstract-algebra","title":"抽象代数","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/abstract-algebra","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"group-theory","title":"研究生 高等数学进阶 — 群论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/abstract-algebra/group-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ring-field-theory","title":"研究生 高等数学进阶 — 环与域理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/abstract-algebra/ring-field-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"galois-theory","title":"研究生 高等数学进阶 — Galois 理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/abstract-algebra/galois-theory"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"topology","title":"拓扑学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/topology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"point-set-topology","title":"研究生 高等数学进阶 — 点集拓扑","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/topology/point-set-topology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"algebraic-topology-intro","title":"研究生 高等数学进阶 — 代数拓扑导引","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/topology/algebraic-topology-intro"},{"seq":3,"slug":"manifolds","title":"研究生 高等数学进阶 — 流形","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/topology/manifolds"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applied-math","title":"应用数学方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/applied-math","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pde-methods","title":"研究生 高等数学进阶 — 偏微分方程方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/applied-math/pde-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"numerical-analysis-grad","title":"研究生 高等数学进阶 — 数值分析进阶","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/applied-math/numerical-analysis-grad"},{"seq":3,"slug":"optimization-methods","title":"研究生 高等数学进阶 — 最优化方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/advanced-mathematics-grad/applied-math/optimization-methods"}]}]}